ty_caption":"Video by Queen Latifah on October 12, 2026. May be an image of television, costume, microphone, newsroom and text.","caption":{"text":"Patti is one of the mentors who taught me when I was coming up. So when it was time to pick a mentor for my team... I could think of no one better. What was given to me, I get to pass on. #TeamQueen"},"code":"DeaQa0vhHg7","seo_canonical_url":null,"display_uri":"https:\/\/scontent-det1-1.cdninstagram.com\/v\/t51.82787-15\/845996839_18627853741023761_2472428100561849895_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_s640x640_tt6&_nc_cat=108&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiQ0xJUFMuYmVzdF9pbWFnZV91cmxnZW4uQzMifQ\u00253D\u00253D&_nc_ohc=uNuaclueIIgQ7kNvwGXmP-F&_nc_oc=AdoN9bisluNrWGLqnoDUiqRTDV_w8Xz0nlTpoyEE-DjfkCec0xbBLnUqBvZGTG9_DdU&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-det1-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=dkip2JQPOnofhYCUORSwtw&_nc_ss=7b689&oh=00_AQOy-FXfLrkvFv6DPrsUt6VP-JbrqvquICB5Bm1T3rSLZw&oe=6ADC3D83","media_type":2,"product_type":"clips","user":{"pk":"404247760","username":"queenlatifah","id":"17841400712806316"},"id":"POLARIS_4006587030581835835"}},{"node":{"__typename":"XIGPolarisCarouselMedia","pk":"4004501378441985366","__isXIGPolarisMedia":"XIGPolarisCarouselMedia","accessibility_caption":"Photo by Queen Latifah on October 09, 2026. May be an image of text.","caption":{"text":"Paris has The Louvre. New York has The Met. And now L.A. has The Lucas. It\u2019s been a few weeks since the opening, and I\u2019m just now finding the words. Eboni and I watched our dear friends Mellody and George fight for this place for years, and I\u2019m still taking it all in. It started with one comic drawing George bought for $35 in college. Fifty years and 40,000 pieces later, it\u2019s a home for every artist who was ever told their work wasn\u2019t \u201creal art.\u201d This is a wonder worth traveling for. Go see what they built, and bring the kids. They get in free. \u0040lucasmuseum"},"code":"DeS2Ml0mL1W","seo_canonical_url":null,"display_uri":"https:\/\/scontent-det1-1.cdninstagram.com\/v\/t51.82787-15\/843458392_18626780011023761_2356069943467330161_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_s640x640_tt6&_nc_cat=105&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiQ0FST1VTRUxfSVRFTS5iZXN0X2ltYWdlX3VybGdlbi5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=1JwtiS9d9u0Q7kNvwFgxpGf&_nc_oc=AdpSMmf5eKKKXkUerpb7pKw8Q_XemuSAuOgkfikcnthHApZap06x-qzJhBqJxtVyOj8&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-det1-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=dkip2JQPOnofhYCUORSwtw&_nc_ss=7b689&oh=00_AQPtpWfltwZn6hMTzSsT0sok11Jda7pcghX64CW5J0QXAg&oe=6ADC6386","media_type":8,"product_type":"carousel_container","user":{"pk":"404247760","username":"queenlatifah","id":"17841400712806316"},"carousel_media_count":8,"id":"POLARIS_4004501378441985366"}},{"node":{"__typename":"XIGPolarisImageMedia","pk":"4004394734390487793","__isXIGPolarisMedia":"XIGPolarisImageMedia","accessibility_caption":"Photo by Flavor Unit on October 09, 2026. May be an image of text.","caption":{"text":"\ud83d\udea8\u203c\ufe0f\ud83d\udd14 The day has finally come and we are pleased to announce Flavor Unit\u2019s first-ever website! Be sure to constantly check our website on a daily basis due to the fact that the website will be updated all of the time! Experience our new website by just browsing or simply purchasing some of our new merch \ud83d\ude0e Hope you all are as excited as we are \ud83d\udcab\u2728 Link is now in our bio!!"},"code":"DeSd8tzyirx","seo_canonical_url":null,"display_uri":"https:\/\/scontent-det1-1.cdninstagram.com\/v\/t51.82787-15\/840961800_18421635808155659_4757913459094914766_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_s640x640_tt6&_nc_cat=110&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiRkVFRC5iZXN0X2ltYWdlX3VybGdlbi5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=R3vmqCQAF6AQ7kNvwH_mDJL&_nc_oc=AdpdmbS4tTsrvlykLKgRTnOZ30idNj55LBXIkbo2WvFLGzK-Xy78QRPrd2vP8DdYBTA&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-det1-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=dkip2JQPOnofhYCUORSwtw&_nc_ss=7b689&oh=00_AQNGIElkOD_wOKns4IGjb-eY28gDE8CPFvVScyGrlbo-pA&oe=6ADC35FD","media_type":1,"product_type":"feed","user":{"pk":"4648491658","username":"f